    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH8x3403-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:38:49.202+09:00">a report in writing is to be made concerning the favoured crop</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:39:45.113+09:00">Whenever it rains when the crop is already fully grown,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:41:23.714+09:00">and the number of ch'ing which were affected are to be reported in writing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:41:53.782+09:00">floods,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:42:37.234+09:00">or other creatures which damage the crops,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:52:10.736+09:00">Nearby prefectures have lightfooted runners deliver the letter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:40:33.598+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-11T23:01:04.73+09:00">the number of ch'ing concerned is always to be reported in writing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-11T23:01:36.301+09:00">Nearby prefectures have lightfooted runners deliver the letter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-11T23:02:25.699+09:00">distant prefectures have the courier service deliver it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-11T23:03:13.025+09:00">By the end of the eighth month ... it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-11T23:03:34.319+09:00">Statutes on Agriculture.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:37:20.538+09:00">Whenever the rain is beneficial</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:37:42.275+09:00">and affects the grain in ear</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:54:30.481+09:00">and the grain in ear, as well as the number of ch'ing [4.6 hectare] of cultivated fields and areas without crops.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:41:21.22+09:00">also the quantity of rain </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:42:22.595+09:00">Likewise, in cases of drought and violent wind or rain, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:51:30.228+09:00">the number of ch'ing concerned is always to be reported in writing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:52:45.672+09:00">distant prefectures have the courier service deliver it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:53:16.863+09:00">By the end of the eighthmonth .... it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-16T19:53:39.448+09:00">Statutes on Agriculture.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2025-11-18T23:07:09.148+09:00">hordes of grasshoppers</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
